# Per-symbol ONNX bundles produced by psx-inference/notebooks/train_models.ipynb
# land here. The directory ships empty in the repo; once you've run
# the Colab notebook you'll drop one folder per trained symbol in here:
#
#   psx-inference/models/onnx/
#       HBL/
#           xgb.onnx
#           rf.onnx
#           lstm.onnx
#           meta.onnx
#           manifest.json
#       UBL/
#           ...
#
# Files are small (~150 KB per symbol) so we commit them to git rather
# than uploading to an artifact store — keeps reviewers honest, and
# inference can boot offline.
